claim.claim-text:
encoding spectrum utilization information associated with spectrum used by one or more user equipments, UEs, in communication with the RAN node, the encoded spectrum utilization information being for transmission to the Non-RT RIC;
decoding a spectrum adjustment policy from the Near-RT RIC associated with the RAN node, the spectrum adjustment policy originating at the Non-RT RIC and based on the spectrum utilization information; and
reassigning the spectrum used by the one or more UEs based on the spectrum adjustment policy.

spectrum used by the one or more UEs in connection with carrier aggregation between a licensed New Radio, NR band of a primary cell of the RAN node and an unlicensed NR, NR-U, band of a secondary cell of the RAN node;
spectrum used by the one or more UEs in connection with dual connectivity between a licensed NR band of a primary cell of the RAN node and an NR-U band of a secondary cell of the RAN node;
spectrum used by the one or more UEs in connection with dual connectivity between a licensed LTE band of a primary cell of the RAN node and an NR-U band of a secondary cell of the RAN node; and
spectrum used by the one or more UEs in connection with dual connectivity between a licensed NR band of a primary cell of the RAN node and an unlicensed Wi-Fi band of a secondary cell of the RAN node.
